{{!-- The record of a recovery — a Rest, or Attributes restored — as its body: the message's
      `flavor` says who recovered and how, and is the caption; the speaker is the character. One
      line per number that moved, from what it was to what it is. The lines are the store card's,
      because this is the same kind of record. --}}
<ul class="cairn-store-card-lines">
    {{#each lines}}
    <li><span>{{localize "CAIRN.Recovery.Line" label=this.label from=this.from to=this.to}}</span></li>
    {{/each}}
</ul>
